["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"“不開玩笑” × 羅永浩的X字路口！折騰未必會贏，但不折騰一定會後悔 ADHD 專注達\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-28-cn2d7912-罗永浩-人应该终生不退休-财富自由的朋友99-撑不过半年就复出/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5d4d85d51d7f33f0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:23:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0228</span></div>\n<h2>羅永浩：人應該終生不退休，財富自由的朋友99%撐不過半年就復出</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說這個判斷不是空想，而是觀察移動互聯網十年裡，身邊一大批實現財富自由、發誓要躺平的朋友，幾乎全都撐不過三到六個月又出來折騰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">羅永浩</span><span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP2 曾燕紅：從中學老師到打破速登珠峰世界紀錄，我唯一不能做的就是放棄 PTSD Free Solo Aim High, Achieve High\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-27-xiaotianzhang-离破纪录仅剩90米-她却选择带队原路撤退/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d38949a273cb9e75-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0227</span></div>\n<h2>離破紀錄僅剩90米，她卻選擇帶隊原路撤退</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">整個團隊已經把消息傳了出去，只剩90米就能刷新珠峰速攀世界紀錄，Ada卻和夏爾巴一起決定下撤——理由是哪怕只有百分之一的風險，她都不願意冒。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">珠峰速攀</span><span class=\"tag\">風險決策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"49 - Caspar Oesterheld on Program Equilibrium program equilibrium Löb&#x27;s theorem folk theorem epsilon grounded fairbot simulationist programs\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-18-axrp-程序均衡-交代码比交人更可能合作-但协调极难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd45e667daa75191-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:32:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0218</span></div>\n<h2>程序均衡：交代碼比交人更可能合作，但協調極難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">程序均衡讓雙方互讀源代碼，用 Löb 定理實現合作；但合作依賴幾乎相同的代碼或共享隨機數，現實中協調成本極高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">博弈論</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"48 - Guive Assadi on AI Property Rights rentier racing to the precipice Roko&#x27;s basilisk Laplace&#x27;s rule of succession\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-15-axrp-给-ai-产权-是为了防止它掀桌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a8ac42151ce3e12-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">2:05:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AXRP</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0215</span></div>\n<h2>給 AI 產權，是為了防止它掀桌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果 AI 擁有產權，它們就更不願意破壞產權制度本身——包括搶走人類全部財產。這不是道德關懷，是風險對沖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 治理</span><span class=\"tag\">產權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"132. 對星海圖創始人高繼揚的3小時訪談：鯰魚、曾國藩、Waymo與Momenta的兩面、一隻狼與許華哲的離開 VLA data recipe sim-to-real gap domain transfer NRE 加 License\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-13-zhangxiaojun-机器人行业不浪漫-链条太长-人得把头伸到土里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0f499571a7c864df-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:04:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0213</span></div>\n<h2>機器人行業不浪漫：鏈條太長，人得把頭伸到土裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">星海圖創始人高繼揚說，機器人創業的競爭是六邊形：整機、供應鏈、數據、模型、渠道、終端，算法傳播週期只有兩三個月，壁壘最小。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"音樂人張瑋瑋×羅永浩！我們都是那個“混亂又偉大”的 90 年代的倖存者 after party\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-11-cn2d7912-舒适环境里创作不出东西-冲突和差异越大反而越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0980c89abd69e75d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">5:39:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0211</span></div>\n<h2>舒適環境裡創作不出東西，衝突和差異越大反而越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民謠樂手張瑋瑋回顧從西北廠礦小城到北京地下室排練的十幾年：父母離婚、國企崩塌、廣州捱餓賣唱、樂隊解散，每一次動盪都沒把他壓垮，反而是後來生活安穩下來才真正寫不出東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民謠</span><span class=\"tag\">90年代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"蔣奇明&amp;雙雪濤×羅永浩！如何成為飛行家 Peaky Blinders\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-04-cn2d7912-看过深圳年轻人的硬件样机后-罗永浩的悲观被打消了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8991b069d150d3a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0204</span></div>\n<h2>看過深圳年輕人的硬件樣機後，羅永浩的悲觀被打消了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這兩年大環境常讓羅永浩悲觀，但去深圳看了一圈20歲出頭的硬件創業者、看到已經打出來的樣機後，他相信紮實的工業基礎能托住下一代，重新樂觀起來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">東北文藝復興</span><span class=\"tag\">電影改編</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: Founder and CEO of NVIDIA vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-01-ch-a-bit-personal-with-jodi-shelton-黄仁勋-nvidia-没有终局计划-活下去就是全部战略/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/862453475cf2ed80-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">A Bit Personal with Jodi Shelton</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：NVIDIA 沒有終局計劃，活下去就是全部戰略</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳說公司從沒有過終局方案，「staying in business」才是唯一的計劃；而他自己最珍視的不是智商而是「character」——這是面試測不出來、只能靠公司在痛苦中鍛造出來的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span><span class=\"tag\">領導力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Factory: Infrastructure for Intelligence | Jensen Huang, CEO, NVIDIA AI factory agentic AI self-supervised learning physical AI TAM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-01-ch-cisco-黄仁勋-你不愿公开的问题-才是公司最值钱的知识产权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5ea8055a378435f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cisco</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：你不願公開的問題，才是公司最值錢的知識產權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達把自己的對話系統留在本地，不是因為答案敏感，而是因為「我在問什麼」比「AI給了什麼答案」更有價值——這條邏輯被他用來反對「全部上雲」的默認選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI戰略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk – &quot;In 36 months, the cheapest place to put AI will be space” mass driver Kardashev scale reticle autoclave sim-to-real gap\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-01-ch-dwarkesh-patel-and-2-more-马斯克断言-三年内把ai算力送上太空会比在地球发电更便宜/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/51a4d508f3ecbd54-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">2:49:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh Patel and 2 more</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克斷言：三年內把AI算力送上太空會比在地球發電更便宜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的論證是：地球電力產出基本停滯，而太空光伏不受大氣和晝夜影響，發電效率提升五倍，還省掉電池，綜合成本只有地面的十分之一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空算力</span><span class=\"tag\">能源瓶頸</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk Joins Panel Discussion at WEF | AC1P full reusability Optimus\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-01-ch-news-central-马斯克预测今年ai将比任何人都聪明-2031年超越全人类/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db9c6609a1ff9232-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">News Central</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克預測今年AI將比任何人都聰明，2031年超越全人類</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬斯克把太陽能、全複用火箭和人形機器人連成一條邏輯：電力是AI部署的真正瓶頸，而成本最低的AI數據中心最終會建在太空裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太陽能</span><span class=\"tag\">太空發射</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"CEO Fireside Chat With Jensen Huang and Pascal Daloz at Dassault Systèmes 3DEXPERIENCE World world model Physics Nemo MBSE\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-02-01-ch-nvidia-英伟达与达索的25年合作-从opengl到ai世界模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31f8b10218ccd6f5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NVIDIA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達與達索的25年合作：從OpenGL到AI世界模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳認為下一代設計工具不再靠人寫結構化幾何數據，而是靠AI理解物理法則和因果關係的「世界模型」，這是比語言模型更難的一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">數字孿生</span><span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"131. 印奇出任階躍星辰董事長的訪談：聰明人的誘惑、取捨、超長鏈路殘酷淘汰賽、階躍函數和超多元方程 VLA foundation model edge MVP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-26-zhangxiaojun-印奇出任阶跃星辰董事长-基模公司做2b和纯2c都不成立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae74dec7a752a3fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0126</span></div>\n<h2>印奇出任階躍星辰董事長：基模公司做2B和純2C都不成立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基模一年至少燒30億人民幣、要維持三到五年，所以做2B或純C端軟件都算不過賬；階躍的賭注是基模加終端，用軟硬一體換一張上牌桌的資格。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"[LIVE] #WEF2026: Conversation with Elon Musk | 22 Jan 2026 Starship Optimus\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-22-ch-astro-awani-马斯克-ai扩张的真正瓶颈不是芯片-而是电力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/40d47ad12bf3fb81-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Astro AWANI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克：AI擴張的真正瓶頸不是芯片，而是電力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">馬斯克說芯片產能很快就會過剩，真正卡住AI與機器人擴張速度的是電力供應，這也是SpaceX和特斯拉聯手三年內建成每年100吉瓦太陽能產能的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"130. 張月光創業兩年首次訪談：妙鴨不是AI Native產品、流程到上下文設計、One Way Door和乙女遊戲 AI Native One Way Door Live2D Context Engineering Q-Time / Save Time\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-22-zhangxiaojun-妙鸭不是-ai-native-产品-它只是把-ai-用好的互联网产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84b4403959914648-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:14:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0122</span></div>\n<h2>妙鴨不是 AI Native 產品：它只是把 AI 用好的互聯網產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張月光復盤兩年創業：妙鴨靠限制用戶自由度換取穩定效果，本質是互聯網產品思維；AI Native 產品要換成面向 context 的設計，而單向門產品才是他願意押上全部身家的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 產品</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"[LIVE] #WEF2026: Conversation with Jensen Huang, President and CEO of NVIDIA | 21th Jan 2026 agentic AI / agentic systems physical AI / physical intelligence AI native companies\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-21-ch-astro-awani-黄仁勋-ai不是裁员工具-而是在制造劳动力短缺/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/29e9678935293569-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">34:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Astro AWANI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0121</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：AI不是裁員工具，而是在製造勞動力短缺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳用放射科醫生和護士的真實案例論證：AI自動化的是任務而非目的，結果反而是醫院擴招而不是裁員，這與AI威脅就業的主流敘事相反。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">就業影響</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"劉震雲×羅永浩！有些玩笑含著淚也要開完\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-15-cn2d7912-乡村不是没有天才-而是天才没赶上恢复高考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5efb79bd917b306-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0115</span></div>\n<h2>鄉村不是沒有天才，而是天才沒趕上恢復高考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果不是恢復高考，劉震雲現在還在種地；他那位邊種地邊解微積分的表哥，很可能本該拿物理諾貝爾獎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文學創作</span><span class=\"tag\">鄉土中國</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EP1 劉嘉玲說，60歲是她的黃金時代\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-13-xiaotianzhang-趁体力还在-刘嘉玲说60到70岁才是她的黄金时代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2805c831609a7cd9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"小\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">小天章</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0113</span></div>\n<h2>趁體力還在：劉嘉玲說60到70歲才是她的黃金時代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她說70歲後體力撐不住旅行與應酬，60到70歲反而是情緒最穩定、最該趁現在去埃及、耶路撒冷這些心願地的十年。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">衰老心態</span><span class=\"tag\">婚姻相處</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Lovart 創始人陳冕×羅永浩！且讓我大鬧一場，然後悄然離去 AI native reward model AGI Agent\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-09-cn2d7912-ai十年内不会让人类没用-这是陈冕押上全部身家的赌注/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21e3cf477d7561e6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:43:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>AI十年內不會讓人類沒用：這是陳冕押上全部身家的賭注</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果AI十年內學不會人類的品味和判斷，像Lovart這樣需要人介入的設計產品就還有價值；一旦判斷錯，公司也會跟著完蛋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">產品策略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"129. 全球大模型第一股的上市訪談，和智譜CEO張鵬聊：敢問路在何方？ MAS Test Time Scaling VLA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-08-zhangxiaojun-全球大模型第一股上市了-张鹏说中国-ai-没有泡沫/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96bd8c162ef0083d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:26:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0108</span></div>\n<h2>全球大模型第一股上市了，張鵬說中國 AI 沒有泡沫</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國資本市場可能有泡沫，中國不存在——中國投 AI 的錢只有美國的二十幾分之一，遠遠不夠。張鵬的邏輯是：離 AGI 還遠、錢還不夠，就更得投，不投它不會自然發生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"LIVE: Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang Keynote at AI Conference 2026 | AI1E OpenClaw NVLink Groq（轉寫中作Grok） Dynamo token factory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-01-ch-dws-news-黄仁勋上修预测-2027年前gpu需求能见度从5000亿冲到1万亿美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9a85c646b8ebb08c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">3:10:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">DWS News</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0101</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳上修預測：2027年前GPU需求能見度從5000億衝到1萬億美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳把去年&quot;5000億美元&quot;的需求預測上修為&quot;2027年前至少1萬億美元&quot;——他給出的理由是，過去兩年AI的算力需求已經暴漲了一百萬倍，而且算力消耗的大頭正從訓練轉向推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Morgan Stanley TMT Conference 2026 | Jensen Huang on AI, Compute, Tokens and the New Global Economy AI factory tokens per watt agentic AI grounding / RAG Claude Code（轉寫為OpenClaw）\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-01-ch-morgan-stanley-黄仁勋-一款ai编程工具三周下载量超过linux三十年总量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/825192b064314643-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">42:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Morgan Stanley</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0101</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：一款AI編程工具三週下載量超過Linux三十年總量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳說這代表提示詞從「問答」變成「執行任務」——模型自己讀手冊、調工具、連續運行，這正是驅動算力需求指數級躍升的新引擎。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"COMPUTEX 2026 | NVIDIA Keynote | Extreme Co-Design: Building the AI Factory Extreme Co-Design Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) KV Cache Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) NVLink\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-01-ch-nvidia-nvidia-数据中心不再是成本中心-而是印代币的工厂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6b4ac23e2e80b318-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">27:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NVIDIA</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0101</span></div>\n<h2>NVIDIA：數據中心不再是成本中心，而是印代幣的工廠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">摩爾定律的物理紅利早已終結，NVIDIA 靠在能源、芯片、基礎設施、模型、應用五層之間做「極致協同設計」，把每瓦、每美元能產出的token數硬拉上去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Tesla Q1 2026 Financial Results and Q&amp;A Webcast TerraFab unsupervised FSD S-curve micro factories\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-01-01-ch-tesla-特斯拉认了-hardware-3-永远无法实现无监督自动驾驶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1916bc85d18b7571-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Tesla</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0101</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉認了：Hardware 3 永遠無法實現無監督自動駕駛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hardware 3 的內存帶寬只有 Hardware 4 的八分之一，官方首次明確這一代硬件做不到無監督 FSD，車主只能付費換裝新硬件才能進入無人出租車車隊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>"]